{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":97,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"85c35542-e86e-42de-9087-8a17033d08bd","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151095882,"PostDateInt":1762051338000,"PostDate":"2025-11-02T10:42:18","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"全球电商负责人(J10424)","OrgId":891405,"Org":"海外市场部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"E-commerce Lead（全球电商负责人｜DTC & Marketplace 全链路）\n\n使命\n打通“种草→转化→复购→口碑”闭环，面向国内与海外双战场，对 DTC（Shopify）+ Amazon/天猫/京东/抖音 等平台的增长与运营 P&L 负责；对新品与新市场机会保持敏锐洞察，形成可复制的增长打法。\n\n核心职责（对标 Anker/EcoFlow 级别）\n1. 增长与P&L\n\n-负责年度/季度营收与毛利目标，管理 CM1/CM2/CM3、MER（广告/内容综合回本）、库存周转与现金流质量。\n-建立 国家/渠道/品线三维经营看板与周度预测机制（Forecast / S&OP）。\n2. 全渠道运营（国内+海外）\n-DTC（Shopify）：信息架构、PDP优化、结账转化、Bundles/订阅/延保与词槽策略。Marketplace：Amazon（A+、-Review、Retail Media）、天猫/京东（货盘、坑位、活动节奏）、抖音（达播+自播+短视频投流）。\n3. 统一 MAP/价盘 与促销节奏，防止跨区串货与价格内卷。\n5.供应链与履约\n-与产销计划协同，制定 安全库存 & 补货模型，规划 海外本地仓/3PL。\n-关注机器人/锂电品类的 Hazmat/UN3480/3481、WEEE/电池回收、VAT/IOSS/US Sales Tax 等跨境合规。\n6.内容与口碑资产\n-统筹 A+内容、Listing图文视频、问答与评价增长机制；沉淀可复用素材库与模板。\n-打造“月度玩法包”与“新手必修课”，提升留评率与复购率。","Require":"1. 4–6 年以上全球/国内电商运营管理经验，至少操盘过 年销千万级（RMB） 以上 DTC 或 Amazon/天猫业务；3C/硬件/机器人优先。\n\n2. 熟练 Shopify、GA4、GTM、Seller/Vendor Central、天猫/京东/抖音后台，熟悉 多币种/税费/合规。\n\n3. 对 新品上市 与 跨区域市场切入 有方法论：能读数据，会做选择，敢小步快跑。\n\n4. 数据驱动与审美并重：既能做 CRO/归因，也懂 内容陈列与品牌一致性。\n\n5. 英语流利；懂德/日/粤语等加分；有海外履约与本地化经验优先。","ClassificationOne":"职能类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"4年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-11-02T10:42:18","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"bbf7ca32-bd91-4f3b-97b0-14f2fb9811a4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093126,"PostDateInt":1761551116000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T15:45:16","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"非标售前解决方案经理(J10090)","OrgId":2886318,"Org":"全球教育营销中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责独立或同销售/渠道一起拜访客户（高校）进行售前方案沟通，挖掘客户需求，解决售前技术问题；\n2、负责统筹高校解决方案标准梳理、定制高校产品解决方案等；\n3、统筹或协助完成教育技术赛项工作，包含如赛事相关产品技术资料输出、赛事文档（赛题、评分表、技术协议）输出，及赛事期间人员统筹和技术保障工作等；\n4、和团队一起探索项目需求，给出良好的解决方案，一起完成开发及调试工作；\n5、根据项目定制需求，规划、设计项目方案，完成相关的调试、DEMO开发，编写相关技术文档；\n6、实时保持对行业动态及新技术的学习、了解、掌握，同时对教育教学规律持续跟踪并加强理解。\n7、负责标准/定制项目的售后项目装调交付和产品培训工作；\n8、支持客户售前、售中和售后流程，解决客户使用产品中出现的技术问题；\n9、负责团队管理工作或领导安排其它的工作。","Require":"1.\t硕士以上学历，机器人工程、机械、自动化、机电、计算机相关专业；\n2.\t从事不少于2年及以上的售前或专业技术岗位优先；\n3.\t具备人形机器人相关工作经历优先，包含从事机器人辐射领域，包含末端、视觉、AGV等，或自动化集成相关行业；\n4.\t了解或掌握至少1种计算机编程语言（C语言/C++/Python/Ros等）可用于定制方案的通讯构架设计，并具备开发评估能力；\n5.\t了解或熟悉主流PLC及其相关通讯协议和编程方式；\n6.\t了解或掌握CAD建图（含相关仿真软件）可用于定制方案的设计；\n7.\t具备机器人（协作机器人、工业四六轴机器人等）应用实操经验者优先； \n8.\t接触过教育领域定制项目经验者优先；\n9.\t接受出差工作安排，有良好的抗压能力，喜欢挑战、主动积极，善于思考，具备较好的沟通和表达能力，有服务意识与团队合作精神。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T15:45:16","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"893d2f4a-0235-4b9b-a64e-23cb9a19d600","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093111,"PostDateInt":1761550539000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T15:35:39","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"国内技术支持工程师（工业方向）(J10069)","OrgId":897300,"Org":"拓展支持部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["全国"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"【岗位职责】：\n1、负责为工业、商业客户提供技术咨询和现场调试等服务，解决客户问题；\n2、负责参与项目评审，根据客户需求执行产品售前方案；\n3、负责客户机器人使用培训 ；\n4、负责提供展会支持，保证公司参展设备在展会期间的正常运行；\n5、负责配合机械和电气相关人员，进行机器人系统在线调试；\n6、负责机器人售前及售中的技术支持；\n7、负责团队项目管理、人员管理工作；\n8、负责完成领导安排的其它工作。","Require":"【岗位要求】：\n1、本科学历，机器人、自动化、机械自动化、人工智能、电气自动化等相关专业；\n2、掌握C语言、Python、PLC等底层编程语言；\n3、具备5年以上机器人调试经验，在焊接/商业/上下料/力控/码垛/复合机器人等使用场景有资深项目经验者优先；\n3、熟悉基本的数字、模拟电路；\n4、学习能力强，可快速掌握新的技能；\n5、沟通能力好，可和客户快速建立有效沟通；\n6、吃苦耐劳，抗压能力强，心态好。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T15:35:39","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"442858d2-686a-44b9-8a93-15866fce4645","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093095,"PostDateInt":1761550095000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T15:28:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"行业销售经理(J10296)","OrgId":891366,"Org":"国内工业营销中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["全国"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"【角色定位】\n1、行业部核心执行力量，聚焦细分行业客户开拓与销售落地；\n2、负责行业重点客户拜访、项目机会挖掘、销售推进、签约与回款；\n3、承接行业战略，将行业打法落地到客户侧，形成标杆项目；\n4、协同解决方案经理与生态伙伴共同完成销售闭环。\n\n【岗位职责】\n1、依据公司行业战略，精准锁定行业TOP的核心客户，制定并执行月度拜访计划、客户攻坚策略与销售目标；\n2、主导客户全生命周期销售管理，覆盖需求洞察、方案统筹、商务谈判、合同签订至回款闭环全流程；\n3、统筹协调区域销售资源与优质集成商资源，高效联动、协同攻坚，推动重大项目顺利落地与交付；\n4、积极参与行业展会、高端客户交流及市场推广活动，强化品牌曝光，提升公司在行业内的影响力与话语权；\n5、定期开展客户状态复盘与销售数据分析，构建并完善行业客户经营地图，实现客户精细化、体系化运营；\n6、深度经营重点标杆客户，推动客户关系从项目级合作向长期战略合作伙伴升级。","Require":"【岗位要求】\n1、本科及以上学历，自动化、机械、电子电气等相关专业优先；\n2、5 年及以上自动化设备 / 工业机器人 / 协作机器人销售经验，有协作机器人销售实战经验者优先录用；\n3、具备5年以上行业自动化方案销售经验（3C电子、汽车、金属机械、新能源）；\n4、熟悉行业业务流程，具备5年以上B2B解决方案型销售经验；\n5、具备较强的项目管理和跨部门协调能力；\n6、对自动化/协作机器人/智能制造有较强技术理解；\n7、强执行力与客户沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":"销售类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T15:28:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"3ba1255e-ec83-4838-a8df-5cf3be5b8d8e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":150826704,"PostDateInt":1701765675000,"PostDate":"2023-12-05T16:41:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"测试工程师(J10015)","OrgId":891380,"Org":"测试部","Category":"社会招聘","Categor